      "answerEn": "clitoris; standard Spanish spells clítoris",
      "noteEn": "Spanish Scrabble uses unaccented vowel tiles even for words that carry a written accent in ordinary text, so the rack shows CLITORIS. Standard Spanish writes clítoris with an accent on the first í.",
      "example": {
        "es": "El clítoris forma parte de la anatomía genital.",
        "en": "The clitoris is part of genital anatomy."
